herdr-pi-subagents

extensions/herdr-agent-state.ts is derived from herdr's Pi integration
(https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr, src/integration/assets/pi/herdr-agent-state.ts,
integration version 9, commit 143bf5fd4781d164260c63fe28e7dc08054ad32f),
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

It was modified to consume the `herdr:busy` event emitted by pi-subagents,
to debounce the idle transition when background work ends, and to disable
itself when herdr's own Pi integration is installed.
